Z||000015||gkozlov||09-25-2001||03:08 PM||||I start clearing first thing tomorrow morning.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  My terminal Leave starts 11 Oct 01.  I will officially be George on 24 Nov 01.  Im going to write a memorandum to post at my unit on how to ETS out of the Army.  This is the most difficult thing Ive ever done in the military.  Nobody seems to know how to clear properly.  There needs to be set guideline to go by to ETS.<P>How the hell are you?  Are you state-side again?  Let me know whats up. <BR> George<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign1_3.jpg">         <BR><A HREF="http://g.kozlov.tripod.com/gkozlov.htm" TARGET=_blank>GKozlovs Fiero Site</A><BR>MSN MESSENGER: wkozlov@hotmail.com<BR>ICQ # 18515452||||reg||1
